  "code": "class Solution:\n    def subarraySum(self, nums, k):\n        # 先说明变量含义，再完成你的实现\n        prev = {0:1}\n        ans = 0\n        total = 0\n\n        for num in nums:\n            total += num\n            need = total-k\n            ans += prev.get(need,0)\n        \n            prev[total] = prev.get(total,0)+1\n\n        return ans\n",
